# terraform-<PROVIDER>-<NAME>

> One-line description of what this module provisions and the single responsibility it owns.

## Usage

```hcl
module "<name>" {
  source  = "<registry or git source>?ref=v0.1.0"

  name        = "example"
  environment = "dev"

  tags = {
    Owner = "platform-team"
  }
}
```

## Requirements

| Name | Version |
|------|---------|
| terraform | >= 1.5.0 |
| <provider> | ~> X.0 |

